From 7070d167ebe71a0a6a75eb89e8fdc090b67a3c2f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:02:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add 53 precon cards missing at the pin as simplified
 (SYNTHETIC) implementations

The 195 official Commander precons contain 53 card names that the pinned card
database (348b37db) cannot resolve. This adds simplified card classes with the
correct mana cost, types, P/T and keywords but WITHOUT their complex abilities,
and registers them (plus a few extra printings of already implemented cards) in
the sets that print them. Evidence class: SYNTHETIC. Games that contain these
cards do not play the printed card and must not be used as rules evidence.

Taken from the Muse fork patch (perf-avoid-nested-playable-copy, head 10931648)
with one correction: the patch also REPLACED six working real cards with empty
stubs (TurbulentDreams became a land without abilities; TurbulentFen, Moor,
Springs, Steppe and Wilderness lost their mana abilities and enter-tapped
condition). That rewrite is not included. With it, seed 5 of the 4-player pod
diverged from the pin (3711 vs 3727 decisions) and seed 10 crashed; without it
both seeds are identical to the pin.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
